In the diagram, rectangle $ABCD$ is divided into four identical squares. If $ABCD$ has a perimeter of 160 cm, what is its area, in square centimeters? [asy]

size(4cm);

pair a = (0, 1); pair b = (4, 1); pair c = (4, 0); pair d = (0, 0);

draw(a--b--c--d--cycle);

draw(shift(1) * (a--d)); draw(shift(2) * (a--d)); draw(shift(3) * (a--d));

label("$A$", a, NW); label("$B$", b, NE); label("$C$", c, SE); label("$D$", d, SW);

[/asy]

